    "updated_at": "2022-06-06T17:42:18Z",
    "body": "Well, if there are updates to widlparser Bikeshed won't catch them automatically, since I pin versions. But I do pay attention to widlparser so it should be fine.\r\n\r\nI only need a Bikeshed bug if it's something that'll mean a new type of definition, or changes to how I do autolinking or something (like the new \"static and non-static can reuse names\" behavior that was recently accepted).",
